messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 19 and 99? Please reason step by step.. I think the correct answer is: 1801\n', '<think>.\nTo solve the problem of finding the product of 19 and 99, we can use the distributive property of multiplication over addition. This property allows us to break down the multiplication into simpler parts. Specifically, we can express 99 as 100 - 1, and then use the distributive property to simplify the calculation.\n\nThe distributive property states that \\( a \\times (b - c) = a \\times b - a \\times c \\). Applying this to our problem:.\n\n\\[ 19 \\times 99 = 19 \\times (100 - 1) \\].\n\nUsing the distributive property:.\n\n\\[ 19 \\times 99 = 19 \\times 100 - 19 \\times 1 \\].\n\nNow, we can perform the simpler multiplications:.\n\n\\[ 19 \\times 100 = 1900 \\].\n\\[ 19 \\times 1 = 19 \\].\n\nSubtract the second result from the first:. Therefore, my final answer is: ']]
